# How to cite this corpus. This is distinct from citing ComStock or ResStock themselves:
# cite a document's publication URL (line 1 of every processed file) for their content, and
# this record for the corpus as an artifact. See AGENTS.md "Citing".
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this corpus, cite it as below and name the release tag you read, so the
  citation resolves to the same bytes later. Cite ComStock's and ResStock's own documents
  by their publication URL.
type: dataset
title: "buildstock-corpus: AI-ready ComStock and ResStock documentation corpus"
abstract: >-
  The documentation of ComStock and of ResStock -- each product's technical reference, its
  site's pages, and its upgrade-measure reports -- extracted to clean, release-tagged
  markdown with a provenance manifest, hand-authored transcriptions of tables and figures
  the extractors cannot recover, a human-readable map, and a machine index. One dataset
  release of one product per folder: ComStock 2025 release 3
  (comstock_amy2018_2025_release_3) and ResStock 2025 release 1
  (resstock_amy2018_2025_release_1).
authors:
  - family-names: Klun
    given-names: Lauren
    affiliation: National Laboratory of the Rockies
repository-code: https://github.com/NatLabRockies/buildstock-corpus
url: https://github.com/NatLabRockies/buildstock-corpus
license: BSD-3-Clause
# Each product has its own release tag. Current tags:
#   ComStock  comstock_amy2018_2025_release_3-v3  (2026-10-16)
#   ResStock  resstock_amy2018_2025_release_1-v1  (2026-11-12)
# `version` below is the most recent of them; cite the tag of the product you read, and
# replace it with a later one if that is what you read. No DOI is minted for this corpus.
version: resstock_amy2018_2025_release_1-v1
date-released: 2026-11-12
keywords:
  - ComStock
  - ResStock
  - BuildStock
  - building stock
  - documentation corpus
  - retrieval-augmented generation
references:
  - type: report
    title: ComStock Reference Documentation
    authors:
      - family-names: Parker
        given-names: Andrew
      - name: et al.
    institution:
      name: National Renewable Energy Laboratory
    year: 2023
    number: NREL/TP-5500-83819
    url: https://www.nlr.gov/docs/fy23osti/83819.pdf
    notes: >-
      The published ComStock reference; the corpus's technical_reference source is its
      per-release LaTeX. Attribute ComStock data per
      https://natlabrockies.github.io/ComStock.github.io/docs/citation.html.
  - type: report
    title: ResStock Technical Reference Documentation, Active Development Version
    authors:
      - family-names: Reyna
        given-names: J.
      - name: et al.
    institution:
      name: National Laboratory of the Rockies
    year: 2025
    url: https://natlabrockies.github.io/ResStock.github.io/assets/trd/ResStockTechnicalReferenceGuide_2025_1.pdf
    notes: >-
      The published ResStock technical reference guide, which has no OSTI number; the
      corpus's technical_reference source is its LaTeX at the tag
      2025_Release_1_upgrades_29_to_32. Attribute ResStock data per
      https://natlabrockies.github.io/ResStock.github.io/docs/citation_data_attribution.html.
